#. <CLT 23>そのプレゼントは渡す事ができません。<CLT>
#. <CLT 3>“重要アイテム”<CLT><CLT 23>ですので…<CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Sorry, but we can't let you give her that. It's what\n"
"we in the industry like to call a<CLT> <CLT 3>key item<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>渡すプレゼントを選択してくださいませ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>What would you like to give her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え？　私にプレゼントですか？
msgctxt "0003 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Huh? A present? For me?"
msgstr ""

#. ありがとうございます。
#. 大切にしますね。
msgctxt "0004 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Thank you. I'll cherish this forever..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少しは喜んでくれたかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean she liked it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私なんかが…貰っていいんですか？
msgctxt "0006 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Is it really okay for me to have this...?"
msgstr ""

#. 嬉しいです…
msgctxt "0007 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I'm happy..."
msgstr ""

#. とっても…嬉しいです…
msgctxt "0008 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I'm just so happy...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>良かった。
#. どうやら喜んでくれたみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I get the impression that she liked it. That's good...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. こんな素敵な物を貰えたのは、
#. もちろんですけど…
msgctxt "0010 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"To receive something so wonderful makes me happy,\n"
"but..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君から貰えたって事が、
#. 私は１番嬉しいです…
msgctxt "0011 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"...to get it from you, Makoto... I can't begin to\n"
"describe the feeling...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここまで喜んでもらえると、
#. あげたこっちも嬉しくなるよな…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seeing Sayaka so pleased with something I gave her\n"
"makes me happy!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめんなさい…
#. 私…あまり、そういう趣味は…
msgctxt "0013 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "S-Sorry, I'm not really into that kind of thing."
msgstr ""

#. あの…苗木君…
msgctxt "0014 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Um...Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. これは…もっと相応しい人にあげた方が
#. いいと思うんですけど…
msgctxt "0015 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Are you sure there isn't someone else who might be\n"
"more deserving of this...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しまった…
#. がっかりさせちゃったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh-oh... I don't think she was too happy with that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. せっかくのプレゼントなのに、
#. 申し訳ないんですが…
msgctxt "0017 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I know how much this must mean to you, but I'm\n"
"sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. 私…そういう物はちょっと苦手なんです。
#. 本当にごめんなさい…
msgctxt "0018 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I'm...not really interested in things like this. I'm\n"
"really sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>怒らせちゃったみたいだ…
#. 印象が悪くなっちゃったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...think I made her mad. She probably thinks worse of\n"
"me now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり渡す
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Maybe not..."
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0021 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>プレゼントを渡さなくてもよろしいですか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Are you sure you don't want to give her something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
